<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Belgaum (KA-22) | Covered Car Carriers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system prevent scratches during Car Transportation In Belgaum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our hydraulic ramp features anti‑scratch rubberized rollers and precision‑aligned guides that keep the vehicle’s body away from metal contact. The ramp gently lowers the car onto a cushioned platform, and sensors monitor pressure in real time. This combination ensures a zero‑scratch guarantee, even for delicate paint finishes, making it the safest method for car carrier transport in Belgaum.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book a car carrier service from Belgaum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To schedule Car Transportation In Belgaum you’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the vehicle’s registration certificate, insurance policy copy, and a signed consent form. If the move is for corporate reimbursement, an IBA‑approved GST invoice must be requested. Providing these documents upfront speeds up the booking and ensures compliance with all regulatory standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is full‑value insurance included in the price for moving my car from Belgaum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment includes 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. This coverage protects against loss, theft, or damage during the entire journey, whether you’re moving a hatchback or a high‑end luxury SUV. The policy details are outlined in the GST‑compliant invoice you receive after booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it travels from Belgaum to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our fleet is equipped with satellite GPS units that feed live location data to a secure portal. You’ll receive a unique tracking link via email or SMS, allowing you to monitor the car’s progress on the National Highway corridors in real time. This transparency is part of our commitment to secure, hassle‑free car transport.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the door‑to‑door service work for car owners in Belgaum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our door‑to‑door Car Transportation In Belgaum begins with a scheduled pickup at your residence. A trained technician conducts a pre‑move inspection, loads the vehicle using the hydraulic ramp, and secures it with high‑tensile ratchet lashings. After transit, the car is unloaded at your chosen address, inspected again, and handed over with a signed delivery receipt.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes your enclosed container trucks better than open carriers for vehicle shipping?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Enclosed container trucks provide a weather‑proof, climate‑controlled environment that shields your car from dust, rain, and road debris. The multi‑axle design distributes weight evenly, reducing vibration. Combined with live GPS tracking and CCTV monitoring, these trucks deliver superior safety and peace of mind compared to open‑deck carriers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer special handling for high‑value or classic cars during transport from Belgaum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we have dedicated protocols for classic and luxury vehicles. These include custom‑built wooden crates, additional foam padding, low‑speed transit, and a dedicated insurance rider for elevated coverage. Our experienced crew follows a strict inspection checklist and uses the hydraulic ramp’s gentle loading system to ensure pristine condition upon delivery.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
